i.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproductible in cc86322d8dcdf671349d611f47ebf472f5ee1251\nNot reproductible in abf8e1e6f9e165ea209350ab9a98f01feca93b90\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.4.beta (7b1ed520b) - CachyOS Linux #1 SMP PREEMPT_DYNAMIC Thu, 09 Jan 2025 20:57:06 +0000 on Wayland - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - integrated AMD Radeon Graphics (RADV GFX1103_R1) (Radeon 780M) - AMD Eng Sample (16 threads) (Ryzen 7 8845HS)\n\n### Issue description\n\nRecently I tried to compile one of the 4.4 PRs on my new mini PC with CachyOS and Hyprland. Compilation went successful, but for some reason project manager window just dissappear after the loading screen (even when launching it from the Editor by executing the binary with the `--editor` flag and pressing the \"Quit to Project List\" button). Then I tried to compile `master` (which is currently `7b1ed52`) and the result was the same. The same issue applies to precompiled binary of the [4.4 Beta 1](https://godotengine.org/article/dev-snapshot-godot-4-4-beta-1/#downloads). Then I tried to execute it from the GNOME shell, which was successful.\nAlso, I figured out that enabling \"Prefer Wayland\" in the Editor settings fixes the bug.\n\nFor me, it looks more like a Hyprland and/or XWayland issue, but why is it reproductible only in 4.4 then? Maybe it also can be fixed by Godot itself?\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Download or compile 4.4\n2. Launch it.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nNo project needed.","closed_by":{"login":"Nikitf777","id":127026067,"node_id":"U_kgDOB5JDkw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127026067?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nikitf777","html_url":"https://github.com/Nikitf777","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nikitf777/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nikitf777/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nikitf777/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nikitf777/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nikitf777/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nikitf777/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nikitf777/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nikitf777/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nikitf777/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101770/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101770/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"not_planned","pinned_comment":null}